---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '@/components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '@/components/Footer.astro';

const lastUpdated = '2026-05-06';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service: TTP">
  <Navbar />
  <main class="wrap-narrow pb-20 pt-16 text-muted">
    <h1 class="display mb-2 text-[clamp(2rem,1.4rem+1.8vw,2.75rem)] text-text">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mono mb-10 text-xs text-faint">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <p class="mb-6">
      By installing or using TTP (Talk To Paste, "the app"), you agree to these terms.
      If you do not agree, do not install the app or stop using it.
    </p>

    <h2 class="display mb-3 mt-12 text-xl text-text">1. The service</h2>
    <p class="mb-6">
      TTP is a desktop application that records audio from your microphone, sends it to a third-party transcription provider (Groq), and pastes the result into the focused window.
      The app runs on your computer; we do not host or process your audio on our infrastructure.
      Transcription quality, latency, and availability depend on Groq and on your internet connection.
    </p>

    <h2 class="display mb-3 mt-12 text-xl text-text">2. What is free, and what is sold</h2>
    <p class="mb-3">
      Every feature of TTP that makes a transcription happen &mdash; dictation, AI Polish, the dictionary,
      history, languages, hands-free mode, updates &mdash; is free and uncapped. There is no trial, nothing
      expires, and nothing counts your usage. The caps that existed in earlier versions (AI Polish, dictionary
      and history) were removed on 28 August 2026.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-6">
      One optional purchase exists, sold through Lemon Squeezy as <strong>TTP Pro</strong> and called
      <strong>the Companion</strong> inside the app. It is a one-time payment and it unlocks cosmetics only:
      a face for the floating bar, four additional coats, six sound packs, and a manual. It does not change
      what the app can do.
    </p>

    <h2 class="display mb-3 mt-12 text-xl text-text">3. License</h2>
    <p class="mb-6">
      We grant you a non-exclusive, non-transferable license to install and use TTP on the number of machines covered by your purchase
      (the free app: unlimited installs; the Companion: per the activation count shown at checkout).
      You may not redistribute, resell, decompile, reverse-engineer, or remove any license-enforcement mechanisms in the app.
    </p>

    <h2 class="display mb-3 mt-12 text-xl text-text">4. Payment, refunds, and cancellation</h2>
    <p class="mb-6">
      All Pro purchases are processed by Lemon Squeezy. Pricing, taxes, and currency are shown on the checkout page.
      Pro is a one-time purchase; there is no recurring subscription. Refunds are handled per Lemon Squeezy's standard refund window: contact <a class="link" href="mailto:amirksmain@gmail.com">amirksmain@gmail.com</a> within 14 days of purchase if the product doesn't work for you.
    </p>

    <h2 class="display mb-3 mt-12 text-xl text-text">5. Your responsibilities</h2>
    <ul class="mb-6 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 marker:text-faint">
      <li>You are responsible for the content you record and transcribe. Do not record people without consent or in jurisdictions where it is illegal.</li>
      <li>You are responsible for safeguarding your Groq API key. TTP stores it in your OS keychain, but you must keep your account secure.</li>
      <li>You agree to comply with Groq's terms of service for any audio sent through the app.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="display mb-3 mt-12 text-xl text-text">6. Disclaimers</h2>
    <p class="mb-6">
      TTP is provided "as is", without warranties of any kind, express or implied, including merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement.
      Transcription is performed by Groq; we make no guarantee about accuracy, completeness, or fitness for any specific use.
      The app may stop working at any time if Groq, Lemon Squeezy, or any third party we depend on changes their terms.
    </p>

    <h2 class="display mb-3 mt-12 text-xl text-text">7. Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p class="mb-6">
      To the maximum extent permitted by law, TTP and its author are not liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages,
      or any loss of profits, data, or use, arising from or related to the app.
      Our total liability for any direct damages is limited to the amount you paid for the app in the 12 months preceding the claim.
    </p>

    <h2 class="display mb-3 mt-12 text-xl text-text">8. Termination</h2>
    <p class="mb-6">
      You may stop using the app and uninstall it at any time. If you breach these terms (e.g. by attempting to circumvent license enforcement),
      we may terminate your license without refund.
    </p>

    <h2 class="display mb-3 mt-12 text-xl text-text">9. Governing law</h2>
    <p class="mb-6">
      These terms are governed by the laws of France. Any dispute will be resolved in the competent courts of France, subject to mandatory consumer-protection laws of your country of residence.
    </p>

    <h2 class="display mb-3 mt-12 text-xl text-text">10. Contact</h2>
    <p class="mb-6">
      Questions about these terms:
      <a class="link" href="mailto:amirksmain@gmail.com">amirksmain@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
